  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-27-59"><seg source="#source-27-59">海鳴りのとゞろく日は</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-59-82"><seg source="#source-59-82">船もより来ぬを</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-82-111"><seg source="#source-82-111">火の山の燃え熾りて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-111-131"><seg source="#source-111-131">雲のながるゝ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-131-166"><seg source="#source-131-166">海鳴り寄せ来る椿の林に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-166-192"><seg source="#source-166-192">ひねもす百合掘り</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-192-210"><seg source="#source-192-210">今日もはてぬ</seg></p>
    </body>
